/*!

\page benchmarks Benchmarks
\tableofcontents

This page contains set of graphs with data from benchmarks on different platforms.  

Benchmarks were configured using Conan (see: [conanfile](https://github.com/adam-brz/YABIL/blob/master/benchmark/conanfile.txt)).
Following options were used:

\code{.text}
boost/*:zlib=False
openssl/*:no_zlib=True
yabil/*:cuda=True
yabil/*:tbb=True
yabil/*:native_optimizations=True
yabil/*:digit_type=auto
openssl/*:no_asm=False
gmp/*:disable_assembly=False
\endcode

All graphs are generated using [plotly](https://plotly.com/javascript/).

\note Take note of x-axis values. For example in case of addition benchmarks number values go up to 2**10'000'000, which is a lot.

@htmlonly
<noscript>
    <p>This section requires javascript.</p>
</noscript>
<script src="https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-3.0.1.min.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
<script src="./scripts/benchmarks.js"></script>
@endhtmlonly

